    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the problem is there aren't any \"corners.\" it's just... it's just the same cycle. wake up, try to act like a human, fail, sleep. and then repeat. i look at people and they just seem to *get it* so easily. it's like they're all playing a game i wasn't even given the rules for. it just feels so empty. like there's no end to the effort.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
